23:["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Wire the factory"}],": an import and a match arm in\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge-store/src/default_store_factory.rs"}],". The match is exhaustive,\nso this one is a compile error if you forget it. It is the only step that\nis."]}]}]
24:["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["Add the file to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge-store/BUILD.bazel"}]]}],", in the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"srcs"}]," list,\n",["$","strong",null,{"children":"alphabetically"}],". Cargo does not care. Bazel does, and CI runs Bazel;\nthis is the single most common way a store PR goes red after a green\nlocal run."]}]}]
