29:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"update"}]," must drain its reader"]}]," even when it is discarding the data.\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"NoopStore"}]," does this; a store that returns early without draining will hang\nits writer."]}]
